Package: gitextensions
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: git (>= 2.36), openssh-client, xdg-utils, ca-certificates, tzdata, libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1, libgssapi-krb5-2, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libbrotli1, libssl3t64 | libssl3, libicu78 | libicu76 | libicu74 | libicu72 | libicu70, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1
Homepage: https://github.com/Azreal42/gitextensions
Description: graphical Git repository manager
 Browse repository history, inspect changes, stage files, create commits,
 and manage branches using a native Linux desktop interface.
 The .NET runtime is included; an X11 or XWayland session is required.
